 Q(2,'-ing neden','___ hungry, I made a sandwich.','Feeling',['Felt','Having feel'],'Neden: -ing.'),
 Q(2,'İsimden sonra V3','The documents ___ yesterday have arrived.','sent',['sending','sends'],'which were sent → sent.'),
